    CerednikDrinfeld.exists_classSet_equiv_ssPlaces_one_kernelIdealSet_of_rationalEndSubring q' (WeierstrassCurve.ofJ j₀) hss₀ a b hdef Λ₀ hΛ₀ θ₀ hθ₀ hθ₀Λ
